{"lyrics":"[Intro: Nicki Minaj]\n[00:00.28]Bad bitches run the world, let me make it clear\n[00:03.24]When I leave Juice WRLD, I'm back to pink hair\n[Interlude: Juice WRLD]\n[00:05.64]Haha, Max Lord in this bitch preachin', haha\n[00:14.62](\n[00:14.70]Gezin\n[00:15.02])\n[00:16.64]Fuck the blunt up, haha, yeah\n[Bridge: Juice WRLD]\n[00:21.96]I'm on marijuana (Marijuana)\n[00:24.12]My lean plug say he'll be here in a second (Pull up)\n[00:27.00]I'm getting high, I'm feelin' restless (I'm sad)\n[00:29.58]Feel like I'm finna die (R.I.P.)\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:32.34]I fuck the blunt up, then fuck your momma (Uh-huh)\n[00:35.40]My VVS cold like a arctic tundra\n[00:37.96]40 on me, woah, you don't want no problems\n[00:40.90]And you best proceed with some caution, yeah\n[00:45.16]This song for the girl with the blonde hair\n[00:47.30]Suck me up good, give me Becky like, yeah\n[00:49.82]She ride it like, yeah, in a Versace chair\n[00:53.02]Her boyfriend heated like a grill, no Hibachi, yeah\n[Verse 1: Nicki Minaj]\n[00:56.56]This Young Money ENT, fuck that negative Nancy\n[00:58.84]I'm still ballin', I'm still ballin', NBA on TNT\n[01:02.02]Came through drippin', D&G, always duckin' TMZ\n[01:05.40]Flow still need that EMT, tell her get at me and see\n[01:08.18]I'm the toppa-toppa, bitches is a Khan like Chaka\n[01:11.12]I get it before they cop it, always been that type of shopper\n[01:14.10]And I never tell a lie, I just put one in the sky\n[01:17.16]I just popped me a transformer, gettin' money 'til we die\n[01:20.02]'Til we die, we gon' be fly, made a milli' in Shanghai\n[01:23.18]I don't need job applications for that pressure I apply\n[01:25.88]That is why they gotta lie, that is just how they get by\n[01:29.06]But my flow still gon' be wavy and your flow still gon' be dry\n[01:32.14]I done fucked the world up in ten short years\n[01:35.02]Had teachers like Weezy F. and been all ears\n[01:38.08]Lose studs that's VVS, then get more pairs\n[01:41.04]They been prayin' on my downfall, still need more prayers\n[Pre-Chorus: Nicki Minaj & Juice WRLD]\n[01:44.10]I'ma fuck the bag up and fuck your daddy\n[01:47.50]I'ma stay up like I popped three Addys\n[01:50.42]Girl with the blonde hair, they call me Barbie\n[01:53.40]Let's get faded and have a party, yeah\n[01:57.22]If you got that bomb, put your hands in the air\n[02:00.36]Bad bitches run the world, let me make it clear\n[02:03.18]When I leave Juice WRLD, I'm back to pink hair\n[02:08.72]Catch me somewhere fuckin' the blunt up and fuckin' on your momma\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[02:10.94]Fuck the blunt up, then fuck your momma (Uh-huh)\n[02:13.08]My VVS cold like a arctic tundra\n[02:14.68]40 on me, woah, you don't want no problems\n[02:17.26]And you best proceed with some caution, yeah\n[02:21.14]This song for the girl with the blonde hair\n[02:24.04]Suck me up good, give me Becky like, yeah\n[02:27.16]She ride it like, yeah, in a Versace chair\n[02:29.38]Her boyfriend heated like a grill, no Hibachi, yeah\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD & Nicki Minaj]\n[02:33.96]I'm high as hell\n[02:36.52]Mind everywhere\n[02:39.40]Still mind over matter\n[02:41.40]Pockets gettin' fatter, elevate like a ladder\n[02:44.60]Thirty in that 40 make you percolate like a dancer\n[02:47.22]I'm colder than the North Pole, Blitzen, and Prancer\n[02:50.18]She say she from the strip pole, she a dirty dancer\n[02:53.20]Her ex-nigga too low, she don't got no standards\n[02:56.28]He ain't right, you don't live a better life\n[02:58.76]Run it up like Jerry Rice, I don't gotta say it twice\n[03:01.80]This is real life\n[03:03.14], your nigga is Fisher-Price\n[03:04.72]Now you read minds, you was thinkin' 'bout how I'm that nigga, right?\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[03:08.60]Fuck the blunt up, then fuck your momma (Uh-huh)\n[03:11.40]My VVS cold like a arctic tundra\n[03:13.90]40 on me, woah, you don't want no problems\n[03:16.92]And you best proceed with some caution, yeah\n[03:21.16]This song for the girl with the blonde hair\n[03:23.76]Suck me up good, give me Becky like, yeah\n[03:25.64]She ride it like, yeah, in a Versace chair\n[03:27.36]Her boyfriend heated like a grill, no Hibachi, yeah\n[Outro: Nicki Minaj]\n[03:29.28]Said he want the pretty girl with the blonde hair\n[03:36.14]Fatty on the Max like some Nike Air\n[03:39.14]Fuck his last girl 'cause I am her nightmare\n[03:41.66]Lookin' this good shouldn't even be fair\n[03:45.16]Said he want the pretty girl with the blonde hair\n[03:48.16]Fatty on the Max like some Nike Air\n[03:51.16]Fuck his last girl 'cause I am her nightmare\n[03:53.66]Lookin' this good shouldn't even be—\n[03:56.40]Fuck the girls that just hate on baddies\n[03:59.42]Shout the bad bitches that act all bratty\n[04:02.42]Nothin' but all this designer on me\n[04:05.44]All of my niggas throwin' up gang signs for me","words":[[0.28,0.46,"Bad"],[0.62,0.96,"bitches"],[1.02,1.16,"run"],[1.2,1.24,"the"],[1.36,1.62,"world,"],[1.76,1.86,"let"],[1.92,2.0,"me"],[2.12,2.36,"make"],[2.44,2.46,"it"],[2.7,2.8,"clear"],[3.24,3.42,"When"],[3.48,3.48,"I"],[3.6,3.82,"leave"],[3.98,4.4,"Juice"],[4.46,4.52,"WRLD,"],[4.56,4.64,"I'm"],[4.72,4.84,"back"],[4.9,4.96,"to"],[5.08,5.38,"pink"],[5.42,5.6,"hair"],[5.64,5.72,"Haha,"],[5.8,6.18,"Max"],[6.38,6.6,"Lord"],[6.72,6.78,"in"],[6.92,7.12,"this"],[7.16,7.7,"bitch"],[10.4,14.48,"preachin',"],[14.54,14.6,"haha"],[14.62,14.64,"("],[14.7,15.0,"Gezin"],[15.02,15.36,")"],[16.64,16.86,"Fuck"],[17.2,17.26,"the"],[17.36,17.68,"blunt"],[18.08,19.96,"up,"],[20.0,21.4,"haha,"],[21.66,21.92,"yeah"],[21.96,22.06,"I'm"],[22.34,22.42,"on"],[22.46,23.74,"marijuana"],[23.78,24.06,"(Marijuana)"],[24.12,24.14,"My"],[24.18,24.26,"lean"],[24.3,24.42,"plug"],[24.48,24.7,"say"],[24.74,24.86,"he'll"],[24.9,24.98,"be"],[25.08,25.34,"here"],[25.38,25.42,"in"],[25.48,25.48,"a"],[25.54,25.78,"second"],[25.82,26.02,"(Pull"],[26.06,26.94,"up)"],[27.0,27.04,"I'm"],[27.14,27.46,"getting"],[27.5,27.7,"high,"],[28.02,28.08,"I'm"],[28.26,28.6,"feelin'"],[28.64,29.38,